        <obo:IAO_0000115>A B. melitensis vaccine that is recombinant B. melitensis Rev. 1 vaccine with the bp26 deletion. It has similar vaccine efficacy to Rev. 1. Its advantage compared to Rev. 1 is that this feature of bp26 deletion promotes diagnosis. PMID:17070627.</obo:IAO_0000115>
